This repository contains an ONNX conversion made by Drew Bednar for
go-phonmatchnet, from the repackaging androiddrew/g2p-en-decoder-pytorch
(revision v1, commit fc55559c25a12fce6e0cf9062729e7f2a9fc1ddc). It is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the g2p_en authors.

Modifications to the original work: the NumPy arrays were renamed and stored
in safetensors format, then the network was split into a word-encoder graph
and a single-step decoder graph and exported to ONNX. Values are unchanged.
No training or fine-tuning was performed.
